  "schema_version": 1,
  "evidence_class": "Original native complete name-table lookup loops executed for four exact sources:2321 vectors, zero failures. Not full JSON/socket/crypto/UART transactions or boot/mainboard calibration. Literal model expectations remain independently source-derived.",
  "evidence": [
    "CatalogQuirks/RealtekEarly/wb-handoff.json",
